{"id":"5803","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5803_main_stratocumulus-castellanus-beneath-stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张壮观的中国香港图片捕捉到了天空中的三个层积云种：荚状、堡状和成层。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状云</span>共有最低的云底（600米），因为不稳定性正在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">此处</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">此处</span>荚状云中引起积状角塔发展。图中清晰可见堡状云的基本特征：“成行排列的积状云块，从共同水平云底升起”。</p>\n<p>深灰、厚层的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蔽光层状层积云</span>在图片顶部（云底1400米），是由合并的长卷轴构成。该云层的东北边缘正在逐渐<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">变薄并消散</span>，地平线上的浅灰色以及日光便是证明。</p>\n<p>相同云底的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云块</span>和一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>单体可被视为低层积云。由于积云和层积云位于不同的云底且积云的扩散并未形成层积云，因此编码为CL = 8。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Barry Chan","location":"中国，香港，太平山","latitude":"纬度: 22° 16' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 30'' E","date":"07 June 2014 0825 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.4"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5803_syn_stratocumulus-castellanus-beneath-stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当天，低压槽持续影响华南沿海地区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5803_upper_stratocumulus-castellanus-beneath-stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在此次探测中，高水汽含量区域表明上至7500米有一些不同的云层</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5527_main_stratocumulus-lenticularis-undulatus_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图为英国苏格兰加洛韦山背风坡的薄层积云中的波浪（横向波 – 波状云类）。该层积云为荚状云种，因为波浪原地不动（驻波），但它们在不断变化，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上风边缘</span>形成，并在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下风边缘</span>消散。</p>\n<p>地平线方向隐约可见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">反曙暮辉</span>及其连带的阴影。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Cherie Churchill","location":"英国，邓弗里斯-加洛韦DG8 7EU，纽顿斯图尔特，克里敦","latitude":"纬度: 54° 53' 59'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 20' 54'' W","date":"17 October 2015 0906 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.7.10 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.7.10 2"}]}]}